く重いものを抱えていそうな遠野を気にかけている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ムシクイには入ったばかりで、それまで縁のなかった悪意に満ちた世界に衝撃を受けている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17616","sourceWorkId":"26026","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"2年生。遠野のクラスメイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰にでも好かれる心優しい少女で、相手のちょっとした仕草から深く心理を見抜く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それゆえに、何かとてつもなく重いものを抱えていそうな遠野を気にかけている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ムシクイには入ったばかりで、それまで縁のなかった悪意に満ちた世界に衝撃を受けている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59826"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dc60b6a315b4f68bb95eeeda7873a1a9a2a447cb394cf2f97498a255a612a3ca.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/daf05eb50caa2701e858e57d6b9689b401a0b5417840a04c2e52948730cc5735.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"花澤さくら","creatorId":"vndb:s947","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s947","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s947","name":"花澤 さくら","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:228194:59826:17075:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c64901","characterName":"氷室 千歳","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59825","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"228194"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17617"],"vndbCharacterId":"c64901"},"originalCharacterName":"氷室 千歳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"906"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A senior who aims to become a profiler. She has good analytical skills but cannot read other people's emotions very well. Lives in the same apartment as Toono."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her parents were murdered while she was confined in a closet. Tonoo managed to talk to her on the scene and recruited her to Mushikui afterwards."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64901"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"３年生。文字情報の暗記力を生かして過去の事件をインプット、情報を分析し、事件の行く末や犯人の人となりを推理する。白織市独自のプロファイリングの手法を確立させるのが夢。シャープな外見に反して、世間ずれしていないおっとりとした性格。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17617","sourceWorkId":"26026","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"3年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"文字情報の暗記力を生かして過去の事件をインプット、情報を分析し、事件の行く末や犯人の人となりを推理する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"白織市独自のプロファイリングの手法を確立させるのが夢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"シャープな外見に反して、世間ずれしていないおっとりとした性格。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59825"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f6ad69976d4e2239dfd825da3ebe63a3c3b498c9eba8b1052196987a1ab208e9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/de/de9b9ae0890bd630a153f9e6f9bb543b8809815b8b6d1fe3575fdbabbe726ec0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"石原舞","creatorId":"vndb:s985","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s985","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s985","name":"石原 舞","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:228194:59825:13372:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c64902","characterName":"早乙女 羽矢","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59824","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"228194"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17618"],"vndbCharacterId":"c64902"},"originalCharacterName":"早乙女 羽矢","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"401"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A first-year with extraordinary physical strength. She hates criminals, and would prefer to fight rather than investigate. Has a large network of friends and is good at gathering information."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64902"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"１年生。並外れた身体能力を持つ。犯罪者を憎んでおり、捜査よりも犯人との格闘に執心する。気ままな性格もあって捜査には向いていないが、やたらと広い交友関係が情報収集に役立つことも。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17618","sourceWorkId":"26026","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"1年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"並外れた身体能力を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"犯罪者、特に精神病質者を憎んでおり、捜査よりも犯人との格闘に執心する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気ままな性格もあって捜査には向いていないが、やたらと広い交友関係が情報収集に役立つことも。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59824"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/524be2494ba74aaa86ea4c3aa5686ffc7cab0ec74d8d22f278c433da85857b99.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe848de042655cdba232217662821afb5dbe355925350a6353874367ac9fb30f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"前田恵","creatorId":"vndb:s11","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11","name":"前田 恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:228194:59824:8580:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c64903","characterName":"遠野 圭介","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"63107","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"228194"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17619"],"vndbCharacterId":"c64903"},"originalCharacterName":"遠野 圭介","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"104"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A sophomore who is the \"leader\" of the insect gastronomy club. He has an ability called \"Butterfly Seeker,\" which allows him to visualize the cause of an incident."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64903"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。事件の原因となった光景（たいていは日常的で些細なエピソード）を幻視する「バタフライ・シーカー」という能力を持ち、現在の「ムシクイ」のリーダーを務める。冷静沈着で慎重な性格だが、悲劇を減らしたいという強い思いから、たまに熱い一面を覗かせる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17619","sourceWorkId":"26026","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"長所は、真面目、冷静、優しい、（本質は）熱い、ストイック、意志が強い、判断力がある、頼もしい、几帳面、周囲の人間を大切にする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"短所は、性格・短所　お固い、口数が少ない、犯罪捜査以外に関心がない、自分を大切にしない、現実感が薄い、たまに神経質（割れ物の取り扱いなど）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見は真面目でおとなしそうな眼鏡くん。どこのクラスにもひとりはいるタイプで、主人公より脇役・モブに相応しい地味なオーラを放っています。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来は外見通りの性格だったのですが、６年前に大きな事件に巻き込まれたこと、その後同事件の衝撃を引きずって学生捜査員になったことから、本人も知らなかった熱血な一面が目を覚ましました。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人当たりはよく、誰に対しても礼儀は欠かしません。が、犯罪への憎悪は人一倍深く、捜査開始ともなればその胸には決意と覚悟の炎が燃え盛ります。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そしてヒロインたちは、ストイックに犯罪捜査にあたる彼の姿を見て、尊敬と同時に危うさを感じてしまうわけです。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"63107"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/db8312a9dda5141da9f5cb439c94910988077c01beec88408ba62df4eddfa91b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b42cc105fb5bf2f27f50d4ce57468afbf3628695c0ebe9e11f1006316ac5c96a.webp","width":256,"height":144,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c64904","characterName":"桐生 梓","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59823","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"228194"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17620"],"vndbCharacterId":"c64904"},"originalCharacterName":"桐生 梓","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":